WEBVTT

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:11.730
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:17.240
<i>tsukanoma no yasuragi mo furikitte</i>
Shaking off the desire to rest

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:23.410
<i>hitasura massugu ni hashiri tsuzuketa</i>
I resume my forward journey

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:26.540
<i>nagareru ase nuguwazuni</i>
Without wiping the sweat off my brow

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:34.590
<i>butsukarukotode fukaku musubitsuku yuujou</i>
The friendship that grows through fighting

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:40.680
<i>kizutsuitakoto wa mudaja nakattane</i>
Getting hurt was never a waste

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.600
<i>kanashimi ni kureta toki</i>
When you're wallowing in sorrow

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:49.730
<i>sotto te o sashinobete miyou</i>
Let's reach out with your hand

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:52.940
<i>kitto itsumademo tomo wa</i>
I'm sure friends will be there

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:57.200
<i>kimi o mimamotte iru</i>
Watching over you

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:00.620
<i>hitorija naikara</i>
Since we are not alone

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:04.620
<i>chikaiaou kitto</i>
Let's swear to each other

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:09.380
<i>itsuka jidai ga kawattemo</i>
That even when times change

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:12.380
<i>boku wa wasurenai</i>
I will never forget you

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:16.630
I trust you forever

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:25.520
Now, everyone.

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:27.350
Something terrible has happened.

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:31.360
Wong Yun Fat thinks he knows
the trespasser who saw...

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:32.730
...the Devil Gundam.

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:35.900
His suspicions point to
Domon Kasshu.

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:37.820
In order to protect his secret...

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:40.870
...Wong has announced
a formidable match-up.

00:01:41.320 --> 00:01:42.370
Well...

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:45.160
...Domon Kasshu's
next opponents are...!

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:49.580
Yes!

00:01:49.580 --> 00:01:52.380
Wong has announced that,
one by one...

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:55.510
...the Shuffle Alliance will
face off against Domon!

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:56.630
And...

00:01:56.630 --> 00:01:58.970
...his first opponent is...

00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:00.890
...Gundam Maxter.

00:02:00.890 --> 00:02:03.430
The man with burning fists,
Chibodee Crocket!

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:05.100
In this inevitable match...

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:08.020
...we can expect a fight
from Chibodee...

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:10.650
...different from
anything we've seen before!

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:12.020
And now!

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:16.570
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:22.660
Showdown!
Bursting Machinegun Punch

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:24.660
Chibodee, one more shot!

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:26.410
Over here! Please look this way!

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:27.370
Thank you!

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:31.620
Here!

00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:34.630
If my fellow Neo Americans
are going to get a kick out of it...

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:36.500
...I'll do any kind of pose.

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:37.630
That's right.

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:39.340
All of Neo America...

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:41.800
...is confident that you will
win the championship!

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:42.760
However...

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:44.140
"However"?

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:45.680
What's this "however"?

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:47.600
What we're concerned about...

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:51.030
...is that your next opponent is
one you've faced many times.

00:02:51.030 --> 00:02:53.770
Yet each bout had an
indecisive outcome.

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:55.020
His name is...

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:56.900
...Domon Kasshu!

00:02:57.070 --> 00:02:57.730
Right!

00:02:57.730 --> 00:02:59.030
Can you win against him?

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:01.450
We'd like to hear
your comments on this!

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:04.820
Please let us know how you
really feel, Chibodee!

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:07.330
Lt-it's getting out of hand.

00:03:10.870 --> 00:03:12.500
Domon Kasshu?!

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:18.250
Let me tell you one thing.

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:19.960
In the next Fight...

00:03:19.960 --> 00:03:22.470
...Neo America will
see the beauty of my dream.

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:25.220
Yes! The people will see a
victorious Chibodee Crocket!

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:32.480
It has finally come, Domon.

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:34.020
This moment.

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:38.860
A tremor?!

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:40.360
What the hell...?!

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:42.550
My Shuffle Crest...?

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:44.570
Don't tell me...?!

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:50.200
That's...!

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:57.090
The Devil Gundam has appeared
here in Neo Hong Kong?!

00:03:57.420 --> 00:03:59.460
As much as I hate to admit it...

00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:17.560
There's no mistaking it!
That's him!

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:22.580
Rise! God Gundam!

00:04:22.580 --> 00:04:23.990
Wait!

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:31.910
Undefeated of the East!

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:34.040
You fool.

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:37.580
You're not helping anyone
by taking your time!

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:38.250
What?

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:40.670
Just watch me.

00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:57.450
I can't afford to
leave any evidence.

00:04:58.100 --> 00:04:59.420
Undefeated of the East!

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:02.110
What did we just see?!

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:05.030
Did you revive
the Devil Gundam?!

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:07.320
Or is my brother still alive?!

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:10.950
You fool.

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:13.080
All I did was get rid of...

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:16.160
...a surviving Gundam Head
that wandered into the city.

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:17.920
Think before you
make accusations.

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:18.920
Then...

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:22.130
...who else besides you is trying
to revive the Devil Gundam?!

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:23.550
Enough of this!

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:24.840
You...

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:26.590
Behind you! Master!

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:30.260
Still alive, I see!

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:32.140
Suibu, saigen kouko!

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:34.100
Tempest wave!

00:05:37.350 --> 00:05:38.440
Explode!

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:42.610
All right!

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:44.610
Undefeated of the East
may be old...

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:46.990
...but as a true Fighter
he's as great as ever!

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:48.490
That's right!

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:50.910
Neo Hong Kong's
going to win it again!

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:54.240
Clearly an amazing technique.

00:05:54.240 --> 00:05:55.580
But something's odd.

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:58.920
Using the Gundam Head
just for show?

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:00.380
Domon...

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:02.790
Don't you worry.

00:06:02.790 --> 00:06:04.340
I'm a martial artist.

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:06.630
I'll make sure the
Gundam Fight continues.

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:09.430
Especially so I can defeat you.

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:11.760
Let's go! Fuun Saiki!

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:13.720
Wait! I've got questions!

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:17.640
Domon...

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:20.110
...the guy unintentionally
called me "Master."

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:28.700
But Mr. Wong, you committed
a huge blunder.

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:29.950
Don't worry.

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:32.990
It's a minor accident that
occurred during transport.

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:34.910
And thanks to the commotion...

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:38.540
...we were able to move the
main body to another location.

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:40.000
Yes.

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:44.290
The Devil Gundam should now
be able to safely self-recover.

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:47.050
That's none other than
the Devil Gundam.

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:52.840
That explains why our troops
vanished in the Guyana Highlands.

00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:55.510
But who knew it'd end up
in Neo Hong Kong?

00:06:55.760 --> 00:06:58.470
Still, I'm heading up to space.

00:06:58.470 --> 00:06:59.980
We must think of a way
to counter this.

00:07:01.390 --> 00:07:03.150
I'm leaving you in charge here,
doctor.

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:12.320
The Devil Gundam's self-recovery
has been activated?

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:15.120
So, that's why our
crests were glowing.

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:16.530
I'd say so.

00:07:16.530 --> 00:07:18.790
It also explains
Michelo and Chapman.

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:21.250
So, now we face an
unwelcome enemy.

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:22.900
Undefeated of the East...

00:07:22.900 --> 00:07:25.010
...is trying to resurrect
the Devil Gundam...

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:27.210
...while everyone's attention
is on the Final Battle.

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:30.270
What we need to do
is find him, and...

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:35.850
What's the matter?

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:36.890
Why're you so quiet?

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:39.890
Now that the Devil Gundam's
turned up here, we have to...

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:41.390
Count me out.

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:42.390
What?

00:07:43.060 --> 00:07:45.480
I cannot assist you on this, either.

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:46.190
No.

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:47.610
Neither can I.

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:48.980
Listen, Bro.

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:51.070
I hate to say this, but I'll pass too.

00:07:51.440 --> 00:07:52.450
What?!

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:53.570
Sai Saici!

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:56.200
Argo! George! Chibodee!

00:07:56.780 --> 00:07:57.580
You guys!

00:07:58.080 --> 00:07:58.700
Domon...

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:01.540
There's no use going after them.

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:04.870
I mean, they've all got their reasons.

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:07.420
Chibodee, for his dream.

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:10.000
Sai Saici, to revive
the Shaolin Temple.

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:12.420
Argo, to free his friends.

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:14.340
And George, for the honor
of his nation.

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:16.090
You have a reason, too!

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:19.640
Yes, but...

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:23.600
...that's exactly why we can't
have the Gundam Fight disrupted!

00:08:25.140 --> 00:08:25.980
Domon!

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:28.310
That's right.

00:08:28.310 --> 00:08:30.360
The only ones who can keep
the Gundam Fight honest...

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:32.150
...are the members of
the Shuffle Alliance!

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:33.860
Chibodee!

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:36.490
Wait, Chibodee!

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:38.570
Shut up! Just leave it!

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:41.490
I understand...

00:08:41.490 --> 00:08:44.330
...my responsibility
to the Shuffle Alliance.

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:46.420
I understand, but...

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:49.590
...right now, at this moment...

00:08:49.590 --> 00:08:53.260
...fighting you has more meaning
than fighting the Devil Gundam!

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:54.760
Chibodee...

00:08:58.430 --> 00:08:59.430
I want to...

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:01.810
...fight a decisive match
against you.

00:09:01.810 --> 00:09:04.060
I'll show you why!

00:09:07.850 --> 00:09:11.020
I developed a new technique
in the Guyana Highlands.

00:09:11.020 --> 00:09:12.980
I haven't shown it to you, have I?

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:13.990
What's this?

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:15.240
Bursting...

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:18.870
...Machinegun Punch!

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:33.920
Chibodee...

00:09:34.210 --> 00:09:35.550
There you have it.

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:37.340
I trust that you'll fight me.

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:39.140
Neo Japan's Gundam Fighter.

00:09:40.220 --> 00:09:41.140
Chibodee...

00:09:41.550 --> 00:09:42.430
Bye!

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:46.730
Domon, what was that?

00:09:46.730 --> 00:09:47.890
Yeah.

00:09:47.890 --> 00:09:51.020
It looks like he's developed
his own Hyper Mode.

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:51.770
What?

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:53.480
You must fight them.

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:56.530
Listen.

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:58.610
I'll look for the Devil Gundam.

00:09:58.610 --> 00:10:01.450
Right now, your job is to bring
the Shuffle Alliance together.

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:02.950
Schwarz Bruder...

00:10:03.530 --> 00:10:05.370
Martial artists are ill at ease...

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:07.910
...and can only communicate
with their fists.

00:10:07.910 --> 00:10:09.920
It's the only way you'll
get through to them.

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:12.040
They'll step forward in due time.

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:14.130
It'll happen when they're
fighting you.

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:16.110
When they're fighting me, huh?

00:10:32.810 --> 00:10:34.820
Chibodee's amazing now.

00:10:34.820 --> 00:10:36.990
He might win against Domon.

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:37.780
No!

00:10:37.780 --> 00:10:39.030
Not "might"!

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:40.570
I <i>will</i> win.

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:41.450
That's right.

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:44.240
My dream is to win the match
against Domon Kasshu!

00:10:44.780 --> 00:10:45.740
Chibodee...

00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:46.910
You guys!

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:48.450
Work with me on this!

00:10:48.450 --> 00:10:49.960
So I can beat him!

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:51.210
Yeah!

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:52.290
Chibodee!

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:54.170
You are the greatest man!

00:10:54.170 --> 00:10:54.920
Yeah.

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:56.170
Neo America's hope!

00:10:56.550 --> 00:10:57.300
Right.

00:10:57.300 --> 00:10:58.170
I am the hope.

00:10:58.460 --> 00:11:00.130
You are Neo America's dream.

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:01.220
That's right.

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:01.880
I'm also the dream!

00:11:01.880 --> 00:11:04.600
So defeat Domon,
and grasp your dream!

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:05.920
Right!

00:11:06.260 --> 00:11:07.180
I'll grasp my dream!

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:08.310
Grasp my dream!

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:11.020
Chibodee! Chibodee! Chibodee!

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:11.850
I am the hope...

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:13.650
I am the dream...

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:16.730
I'll show you my burning
passion for victory!

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:17.480
Yes!

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:20.360
This time I will defeat
Domon Kasshu!

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:24.490
And I will grasp my dream!

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:34.130
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:39.380
Uh, Father.

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:44.590
Why is Major Ulube heading back
before the end of the Tournament?

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:47.560
You saw it, right?

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:49.560
The Gundam Head?

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:51.140
That's right.

00:11:51.140 --> 00:11:54.270
So we must take certain steps
in case things get out of hand.

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:58.440
You intend to hold back the
Devil Gundam through war?

00:11:58.440 --> 00:11:59.480
Of course not.

00:11:59.480 --> 00:12:01.270
It's precisely the reason why...

00:12:01.270 --> 00:12:04.450
...Domon must win the Tournament
to avoid that.

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:07.120
Uh, right...

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:12.360
That's the purpose of this
Gundam Fight, right?

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:21.800
I understand my responsibility
to the Shuffle Alliance.

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:22.840
I understand, but...

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:24.430
...right now, at this moment...

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:27.800
...fighting you has more meaning
than fighting the Devil Gundam!

00:12:30.260 --> 00:12:31.770
The meaning of fighting me...

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:34.520
You must fight them.

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:36.440
They'll step forward in due time.

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:38.690
It'll happen when they're
fighting you.

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:42.070
Domon!

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:43.820
Yoo-hoo!

00:12:44.450 --> 00:12:45.660
Hey, Allenby.

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:46.860
You came at a good time.

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:48.160
I'm going for a workout.

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:49.030
You want to join me?

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:50.790
That's what I'm here for.

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:55.370
Domon?

00:12:56.040 --> 00:12:58.170
Domon? Where are you?

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:02.760
The reconstruction zone?

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:03.720
For training?

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:15.980
No good!

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:17.770
I told you to crush them
continuously!

00:13:18.230 --> 00:13:20.460
I know. But I'm not sure about this.

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:21.020
Look!

00:13:21.020 --> 00:13:22.980
Do it right this time, Allenby.

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:25.900
What good will this training do,
anyway?

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:26.950
Hurry!

00:13:27.410 --> 00:13:29.700
Okay!
You asked for it now!

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:36.080
That's it!

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:37.750
This is Chibodee's punch!

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:51.300
Next! I need more!

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:00.360
I-incredible...

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:06.360
Domon!

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:14.990
You okay, Domon?

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:17.120
Let's stop this, Domon.

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:18.160
No.

00:14:18.160 --> 00:14:21.080
I won't defeat Chibodee
unless I stop them all.

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:23.710
It's impossible to get them
all by yourself.

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:27.170
Impossible by myself...?

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:28.510
What's the matter?

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:31.840
I see.

00:14:31.840 --> 00:14:33.140
Yes, there's a way!

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:34.100
Huh?

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:40.100
I'm ready to take on Chibodee.

00:14:45.110 --> 00:14:45.780
<i>Now</i>...

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:48.570
...<i>we are moments away from</i>
<i>the match between two contenders</i>.

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:49.530
<i>Yes</i>.

00:14:49.530 --> 00:14:51.570
<i>You can feel the ex citement</i>.

00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:54.530
<i>Tens of thousands of fans</i>
<i>have come from Neo America</i>...

00:14:54.530 --> 00:14:58.450
...<i>and can be heard chanting</i>
<i>for their hero, Chibodee!</i>

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:11.630
<i>Gundam Maxter leaves no doubt</i>
<i>he's ready for this match!</i>

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:14.600
<i>Meanwhile, Neo Japan's</i>
<i>God Gundam</i>...

00:15:14.600 --> 00:15:18.770
...<i>remains stoic, reflecting a</i>
<i>tradition of calm simplicity</i>.

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:20.020
<i>And now!</i>

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:22.310
<i>At last we've arrived</i>
<i>at today's decisive battle!</i>

00:15:23.810 --> 00:15:27.280
The time has finally come,
Domon!

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:31.780
Amazing.

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:32.820
It's more powerful than yesterday.

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:36.490
Get ready for this, baby!

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:39.620
Mr. Wong.

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:40.870
Can you feel it, too?

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:42.710
This energy from Chibodee.

00:15:42.980 --> 00:15:43.750
Yes.

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:46.790
It's no longer that
of a human being.

00:15:46.790 --> 00:15:49.800
He has transformed himself
into a beast.

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:51.470
I see.

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:53.300
It's no accident that he's
part of the Shuffle Alliance.

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:54.550
Wonderful.

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:56.890
Then let us get started.

00:15:57.220 --> 00:15:59.770
Here we go! Gundam Fight!

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:01.560
Ready!

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:02.730
Go!

00:16:07.460 --> 00:16:08.320
Just one punch...

00:16:08.610 --> 00:16:10.150
He's knocked back that far?

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:11.650
Chibodee...

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:14.160
Here! Here! Here!

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:19.410
H-he's changed!

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:21.870
Chibodee's much better
than he's ever been!

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:28.230
Wow, what an awesome rush!

00:16:28.230 --> 00:16:30.130
Chibodee's fighting
like never before!

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:31.710
Bet he's remembering
the old days.

00:16:31.710 --> 00:16:34.430
When he hungered to leave
downtown and reach the top!

00:16:34.430 --> 00:16:37.930
Yes, his dream to become
a Neo American star!

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:42.020
It's time to become the star of
our hopes and dreams, Chibodee!

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:43.480
That's right.

00:16:43.480 --> 00:16:45.310
This isn't just for myself.

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:46.690
It's for you guys!

00:16:46.690 --> 00:16:48.150
It's for Neo America!

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:51.690
And most of all, it's for you!

00:16:53.150 --> 00:16:54.450
That's right.

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:56.660
I couldn't stand you.

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:02.000
The humiliation of being beaten
in the city where I was born.

00:17:02.950 --> 00:17:03.880
And...

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:05.540
I will never forget.

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:09.340
That moment I saw you
as my eternal rival!

00:17:11.500 --> 00:17:13.090
I swore then...

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:16.800
...that I'd win against you,
whatever it took!

00:17:25.980 --> 00:17:27.730
Get up, Domon!

00:17:27.730 --> 00:17:29.480
You wouldn't end it like this!

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:32.150
My victory won't mean
a thing unless...

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:33.940
...I beat you with my new technique!

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:35.950
Get up! Get up, Domon!

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:43.450
Y-you sure know...

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:47.750
...how to make me happy,
Chibodee Crocket!

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:52.340
That's more like it, Domon.

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:57.300
Domon's energy is increasing!

00:17:58.550 --> 00:18:01.680
For awhile it looked
completely one-sided.

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:04.520
Chibodee has lit a fire
in Domon's soul.

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:08.850
And they will slam the fists
of their souls into each other.

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:11.730
They've both been enlightened.

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:17.400
Come with me, Shirley! Cath!

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:18.700
Janet! Bunny!

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:20.490
Let's grasp our dream...

00:18:20.490 --> 00:18:22.660
...with this one punch!

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:30.070
Domon Kasshu!

00:18:30.070 --> 00:18:31.170
Yeah!

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:33.540
Bursting...

00:18:33.630 --> 00:18:35.760
...Machinegun...

00:18:35.760 --> 00:18:38.420
...Punch!

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:43.010
How amazing!

00:18:43.010 --> 00:18:44.060
Th-that's it...

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:44.760
Domon!

00:18:44.760 --> 00:18:46.640
How will you counter?

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:49.270
Chibodee's blazing thoughts!

00:18:50.980 --> 00:18:52.340
I can feel it.

00:18:52.340 --> 00:18:53.730
I feel your dream.

00:18:53.940 --> 00:18:55.150
And therefore...

00:18:55.150 --> 00:18:56.690
...I will multiply.

00:18:56.690 --> 00:18:58.490
God Shadow!

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:03.870
What?!

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:14.790
You're kidding!
There's several of him!

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:17.260
The training helped out, Domon.

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:18.380
Chibodee!

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:21.300
If you're going to punch me
ten times at once...

00:19:21.300 --> 00:19:24.010
...I'll become ten Gundams
to counter your attack!

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:36.770
You overcame my
ultimate technique...

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:38.650
Chibodee...

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:41.820
Your hunger ignited
a fire within me.

00:19:41.820 --> 00:19:44.530
The stronger you become,
the fiercer I become!

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:45.490
You're a great rival!

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:48.330
Yeah, that's right.

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:50.660
That makes you Domon Kasshu.

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:52.670
And that's why I
want to defeat you.

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:53.920
Okay, then, come on!

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:55.930
This time it's your turn!

00:19:55.930 --> 00:19:57.090
Here goes!

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:06.390
This hand of mine is burning red!

00:20:06.390 --> 00:20:10.520
Its loud roar tells me
to grasp victory!

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:14.440
Erupting...

00:20:14.440 --> 00:20:18.110
...God Finger!

00:20:31.450 --> 00:20:32.620
What the...?

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:37.040
Chibodee...

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:38.840
Domon...

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:46.390
Chibodee!

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:57.730
I lost again.

00:20:57.730 --> 00:20:59.360
No.

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:01.070
Our true battle's still ahead of us.

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:03.240
As long as we're both around...

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:05.160
...we can fight many times over.

00:21:05.660 --> 00:21:07.530
Great fights.
Like the one we just had.

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:08.910
That's right.

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:10.270
What you said is true.

00:21:10.780 --> 00:21:13.000
Dreams are dreams
because they're endless.

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:14.500
Yeah...

00:21:27.550 --> 00:21:30.430
The folks from back home
seem to understand.

00:21:30.430 --> 00:21:33.180
Show them your dream again.

00:21:33.640 --> 00:21:35.060
Of course.

00:21:35.060 --> 00:21:37.020
It's all clear now.

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:39.730
Next time, I won't lose
against the Devil Gundam.

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:42.900
My crest tells me
there's a way!

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:44.020
Yeah.

00:21:46.070 --> 00:21:48.870
I will never give up!

00:21:50.030 --> 00:21:51.870
You both did well.

00:22:01.790 --> 00:22:02.800
Well...

00:22:02.800 --> 00:22:06.260
...I'll compliment you on a battle
worthy of a martial artist.

00:22:06.800 --> 00:22:07.800
However...

00:22:07.800 --> 00:22:10.760
...will you have such an
honorable battle next time?

00:22:11.140 --> 00:22:14.470
Against George de Sand
of Neo France?

00:22:25.030 --> 00:22:28.820
<i>Donna yume o miteru no</i>
What are you dreaming of?

00:22:28.820 --> 00:22:31.320
<i>Odayaka na negao</i>
Your peaceful sleeping face

00:22:32.830 --> 00:22:36.620
<i>itoshikute kimi no kata</i>
Your gentle, warm shoulders

00:22:36.620 --> 00:22:39.170
<i>sotto dakiyoseta</i>
I draw them closer to me

00:22:40.120 --> 00:22:44.300
<i>hiroi kono tokai de</i>
In this great city

00:22:44.300 --> 00:22:47.970
<i>kimi to mukaeru asa ga</i>
The morning I greet with you

00:22:47.970 --> 00:22:54.680
<i>ichiban taisetsu dakara</i>
Is the most important thing to me

00:22:54.930 --> 00:23:02.230
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa ubaikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot find love

00:23:02.520 --> 00:23:06.780
<i>sou dareka kizutsuketemo</i>
Even if you were to hurt someone

00:23:06.990 --> 00:23:10.360
<i>kimi no egao dake wa yuzurenai</i>
I will never give up your smiling face

00:23:10.410 --> 00:23:17.830
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa mamorikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot protect love

00:23:17.830 --> 00:23:26.670
<i>kimidake o itsumo mitsumeteru</i>
I am always gazing only at you

00:23:33.640 --> 00:23:35.680
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:35.680 --> 00:23:38.180
George has been given
a cruel order!

00:23:38.180 --> 00:23:42.600
He's been told to withdraw from
his Fight against God Gundam!

00:23:42.600 --> 00:23:45.150
His pride has been
wounded as a knight.

00:23:45.150 --> 00:23:48.030
But then he comes up with an
unbelievable way...

00:23:48.030 --> 00:23:50.320
...to challenge Domon to a fight!

00:23:50.700 --> 00:23:52.820
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:52.820 --> 00:23:56.280
A Knight's Pride! Gundam Rose Stolen.

00:23:54.870 --> 00:24:01.780
A Knight's Pride!
Gundam Rose Stolen

00:23:56.280 --> 00:23:58.870
Ready! Go!
